This area is the flat top level of `_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/`, restricted to names I–Z. It holds 1,246 tracked files (642 md, 484 json, 118 py, 1 lean, 1 patch; about 29 MB). The whole top level has 2,208 flat files, beside development/ (1,276 files) and four evidence subfolders.

Almost all of the area is dated evidence of the 2026-10-05 to 10-09 G0 and alignment-grounding programme. 1,210 files were first committed between 10-05 and 10-09; only about 35 were touched after 10-10.

Files come in topic packets. Each topic X has prose (X-ARGUMENT, -REVIEW, -SOURCES, -INTEGRATION, -MATH .md) and machine artifacts (X-CHECK.py, X-CHECKS.json, X-EDITS.json). There are about thirteen families:
- ethics and G0 grounding (218), including 16 universal-grounding attempts that all state they did not establish their target;
- inquiry, learning and correction (331);
- liangzhi, yiti, Wang Yangming and wisdom (140);
- living maintenance (102);
