- the 2026-10-05 root package (12);
- the Becoming plans and measurements (12).

**Live set: 63 files.**
- 46 are bound by sha256 from 43 result records (70 refs).
- Becoming plans and measurements cited by the work board or the canonical chapter: ZERO-PREMISE-PLAN, PART-II-INVENTORY, THEOREM-CONNECTIVITY, MODULE-CLASSIFICATION, SPINE-INTEGRATION.py, WUMING-BOUNDARY-PLAN, REGISTRATION-AND-TESTING-PLAN, RISK-CONDITIONING-INTEGRATION and META-ATTRACTOR-RECONCILIATION.
- The generated README, a compatibility test entry point, and the SESSION-*.json tool data read by tools/research/session_map.py.

The remaining 1,183 files are completed-study or superseded evidence; 587 of them are machine artifacts (18.85 MB). 88 files have no inbound reference anywhere.

**Condition.** Links are healthy. There are 0 broken inbound links from chapters, the board, GOALS or records. Of 7,694 outbound links, 120 are broken, all in 3 files, and 2 of those files are broken by design. The problems are structural:
- 2,208 flat files with no family index;
- 114 of 118 check scripts overwrite their point-in-time receipts in place, and some would now fail if rerun;
- about 11.8 MB of edit ledgers duplicate git history;
- the generativity chain's discovery glob and its 640 known I–Z paths assume the flat layout;
- registry drift resolution uses `git log --no-renames`, so any moved record-bound file would lose its reviewed blob;
- several live plans carry contradictory status lines or Lean names that have since been renamed.

**Proved content** is cited here, not housed here. The Lean results these plans schedule and these records bind live in the pure core: Locality, Sampling, Units, Tower, Testing, Seeking, Capture, the revision modules and TimedResponse. They were freshly checked on main d21b311a (703 steps, empty core axiom report). The "theorems" proved in this folder (ROOT-FOUNDATION R2–R4 and the MATHEMATICS-* files) are hand arguments with finite checks, and they say so.

**Restructure.**
1. Keep the 63 live files at the root.
2. Move the other 1,183 into one dated programme folder, split by topic, with evidence/ subfolders for machine artifacts. Do this through a rename map validated in the style of `check_rename`, with relative links rebased.
3. Before any move, teach the registry to follow moves, widen the chain glob through its maintenance workflow, and update the hard-coded tool paths.
4. Then regenerate navigation, adding family READMEs and an attempt ledger for the 16 grounding attempts.

This area is the base of the Theory of Becoming: the method (theories/becoming/chapters/NONDUAL-METHOD.md), the premise card and §1 of the canonical chapter (theories/becoming/chapters/THE-THEORY-OF-BECOMING.md), the pure Lean core layers L0–L1 (lean/GenerativeCore.lean, Becoming/Frame.lean), the world-first readings (Becoming/Unfolding.lean, Readings.lean, Reading.lean), the premise map (Premises.lean) and the metaethical layer (Metaethics.lean, Significance.lean, Boundaries.lean), together with the records on zero premises and the axiom decomposition.

What is genuinely achieved. The formal work is careful. The core is constructive and has an empty axiom report (no propext, Quot.sound or Classical.choice; receipt I5, 703 steps). It does exact reverse mathematics: requiring the arising/ceasing recurrence law of every finite world is equivalent to excluded middle (World.law_iff_em), and strengthening rest to a named step gives LPO. Premises are shown independent by explicit countermodels. Disclosure is unusually honest in many places: §2 of the full statement says the premise-free laws "exclude no unfolding" and carry no dynamical content; Premises §3 says independence measures the freedom of World's eight fields, not contingency in becoming; §6.15 says the axiom "adds no rule" and that C is a law only because "better" is read as widening. The G0 fold holds together logically. G0 went from asserted to a characterized condition, and then from the condition Unrestricted it is a one-line instance. The theory now asserts no ethical axiom, and its normative content moves to an open question of warrant (§6.13 "What it does not derive").

Main problems.
(1) "Zero axiom" mostly applies the deduction theorem. Any axiomatic theory can be restated with its axioms as hypotheses. The premise-free laws are definitional (change_readings is six `.rfl` proofs) or arithmetic (over_stretch, keep_pace).
(2) The representation builds in more than the declared "discrete steps, Nat amounts, shared index":
- one global linear step order, although §0 lists a definite global causal order as "not assumed";
- every condition is a scalar Nat stock, and dependence is threshold admission (need ≤ level);
- change is quantity exchange, and with the rest relatum plugging any imbalance every level sequence is a run of exchange;
- a fixed smallest unit, with dissipation losing at least one unit per uptake;
- a pre-given type of possible formations, so the generative space is inclusion within a fixed menu.
Several headline laws depend on Nat integrality, and the OPENING and the chapter generalize them: closed systems come to rest, novelty needs gain, bounded parts forget. The records themselves show that the rest laws fail at refining units (laws-at-finer-units).
(3) The unity theorems are encodability results rather than evidence of one relational ontology: World.unity, Contextual.world, Frame.world, Shown.run.
(4) The metaethical results are near-definitional. Valuation.significant_iff propagates along connectivity. Unrestricted makes sig ≡ True. Web.significance_undetermined toggles a free parameter, which the method itself (NONDUAL-METHOD line 90) says shows only non-entailment from a weak representation. Yet README/OPENING footnotes state that the work "derives G0 (that living and further generation ... have basic positive significance)". In fact "positive" is weakened to bare significance, and `living` contains no further generation.
(5) Navigation and staleness:
- NONDUAL-METHOD points to superseded ledgers;
- G0-WARRANT is listed as an active study but never mentions the fold;
- the zh and en status of the 生/生生 readings disagree;
- the canonical chapter is about 962 KB, with three overlapping restatements.

Most of these objections concern what the representation omits or adds. They are not refutations of the full account. The open target (record theory-of-becoming-foundation, status open) correctly states that representability of every becoming is unproved.

